            "body": "### Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR adds comprehensive mobile touch device support for ttyd, introducing an on-screen virtual keyboard panel and multiple touch interaction enhancements. The implementation significantly improves usability on iOS and Android devices by providing:\r\n\r\n- A draggable floating function keys panel (Esc, Tab, Arrow keys, Home/End, Modifiers)\r\n- Touch-based text selection with modifier key assistance\r\n- Clipboard integration (Copy/Paste button)\r\n- Scroll simulation via long-press gesture\r\n- iOS keyboard viewport stabilization\r\n- Application cursor mode support for virtual keys\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n\r\n#### New Components\r\n- **MobileKeysController** (`mobile-keys.ts`): A 469-line TypeScript class managing the virtual keyboard panel with:\r\n  - Draggable positioning with boundary constraints\r\n  - Virtual key rendering (Esc, Tab, arrows, Home/End, modifiers)\r\n  - Modifier state management (Ctrl, Alt, Shift)\r\n  - Long-press scroll simulation\r\n  - Responsive design with ResizeObserver\r\n\r\n#### Touch Enhancements\r\n- **Tap Selection**:\r\n  - Double-tap for word selection\r\n  - Triple-tap for line selection\r\n  - Alt+Triple-tap for \"Select All\" (entire buffer)\r\n  - Shift+Triple-tap for \"Select Visible\" (viewport only)\r\n\r\n- **Scroll Simulation**:\r\n  - Long-press Up/Down arrows triggers continuous scroll\r\n  - Configurable delay (default: 260ms) and interval (default: 90ms)\r\n  - Automatically disabled when modifier keys are active\r\n\r\n- **Virtual Keyboard**:\r\n  - 12-button layout in 4 rows\r\n  - Modifier keys with visual feedback (active state)\r\n  - Copy/Paste button with dynamic label switching\r\n  - Arrow buttons with scroll-on-hold functionality\r\n\r\n#### iOS-Specific Fixes\r\n- Stabilized keyboard viewport using `visualViewport` API\r\n- Fixed background color synchronization with terminal theme\r\n- Prevented layout shifts during keyboard show/hide\r\n\r\n#### Application Cursor Mode Support\r\n- Virtual arrow keys and Home/End now respect DECCKM mode\r\n- Proper key code translation based on application cursor state\r\n\r\n### Technical Details\r\n\r\n#### Client Options (New)\r\n```typescript\r\nmobileKeysEnabled?: boolean;           // default: true (auto-detect touch)\r\nmobileKeysOpacity?: number;            // default: 0.72\r\nmobileKeysScale?: number;              // default: 1.0\r\nmobileTapSelectionEnabled?: boolean;   // default: true (auto-detect touch)\r\nmobileUpDownWheelOnHoldEnabled?: boolean;   // default: true\r\nmobileUpDownWheelHoldDelayMs?: number;      // default: 260\r\nmobileUpDownWheelStepIntervalMs?: number;   // default: 90\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### Device Detection\r\n```typescript\r\nprivate isTouchDevice(): boolean {\r\n    const supportsTouch = navigator.maxTouchPoints > 0 || 'ontouchstart' in window;\r\n    const coarsePointer = window.matchMedia('(hover: none) and (pointer: coarse)').matches;\r\n    return supportsTouch && coarsePointer;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n\r\n- **New File**: `html/src/components/terminal/xterm/mobile-keys.ts` (469 lines)\r\n- **Modified**: `html/src/components/terminal/xterm/index.ts` (+505 lines)\r\n- **Modified**: `html/src/components/app.tsx` (client options defaults)\r\n- **Modified**: `html/src/style/index.scss` (+134 lines, mobile panel styling)\r\n- **Modified**: `man/ttyd.man.md` (added mobile documentation)\r\n- **Modified**: `src/html.h` (auto-generated, contains embedded HTML)\r\n\r\n**Total**: +17,807 insertions, -16,193 deletions (mostly in auto-generated `html.h`)\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n\r\n#### Manual Testing Checklist\r\n- [x] Panel appears only on touch devices (iOS/Android)\r\n- [x] Panel is draggable and stays within viewport bounds\r\n- [x] All virtual keys send correct input to terminal\r\n- [x] Modifier keys toggle and provide visual feedback\r\n- [x] Copy/Paste button switches mode correctly\r\n- [x] Double-tap selects words\r\n- [x] Triple-tap selects lines\r\n- [x] Alt+Triple-tap selects entire buffer\r\n- [x] Shift+Triple-tap selects visible viewport\r\n- [x] Long-press on Up/Down arrows triggers scroll\r\n- [x] Scroll stops when modifier keys are active\r\n- [x] iOS keyboard doesn't shift viewport when shown\r\n- [x] Background color matches terminal theme\r\n- [x] Panel visibility updates on window/viewport resize\r\n\r\n#### Automated Testing\r\n```bash\r\ncd html\r\nyarn install\r\nyarn run check  # ESLint + TypeScript checks\r\nyarn run build  # Production build\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Compatibility\r\n\r\n- **Tested on**: Chrome (iOS + Android), Safari\r\n- **Graceful Degradation**: Features only activate on touch devices with coarse pointer\r\n- **Browser Support**: Uses `PointerEvent` with fallback to touch/mouse events\r\n- **No Breaking Changes**: All features are opt-in via client options (default auto-detect)\r\n",
